{
  "comment": "Every version QGSDK installs, in one place. The scripts and CI read this file; change a version here, nowhere else. Grouped by profile: install the ones you work on (qgsdk install --profile ...). See docs/manifest.md.",
  "python": {
    "comment": "QGSDK's own tooling runs on this Python, whatever the profile. It ships with QGSDK and never with an application. No installer, no admin rights, nothing written outside the prefix. Windows: python.org's official build, as its NuGet package (a zip). Linux and macOS: python-build-standalone, the relocatable CPython build uv uses (a tarball); the system Python is never used. Keyed by platform and machine (uname -m).",
